{"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["# SpaceX Interactive Map with Folium\n","Map launch-site locations and explore landing outcomes geographically."]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{},"outputs":[],"source":["import folium\n","from folium.plugins import MarkerCluster\n","\nsites = {\n","    'CCAFS SLC 40': (28.561857, -80.577366),\n","    'KSC LC 39A': (28.608059, -80.603956),\n","    'VAFB SLC 4E': (34.632093, -120.610829)\n","}\n","m = folium.Map(location=[32, -100], zoom_start=4)\n","cluster = MarkerCluster().add_to(m)\n","for name, (lat, lon) in sites.items():\n","    folium.Marker([lat, lon], tooltip=name).add_to(cluster)\n","m"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{},"source":["## Findings\n","The launch sites are concentrated along U.S. coasts, consistent with safe launch corridors and transport access. MarkerCluster supports exploration of multiple launch records."]}],"metadata":{"kernelspec":{"display_name":"Python 3","language":"python","name":"python3"},"nbformat":4,"nbformat_minor":5}